-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fhow-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3>There is a Telegram channel that I occasionally read and recommend to my friends. I have shared some content from this channel here as well.</h3>\n<h3>I myself believe that we must move forward with both material and spiritual aspects in balance. If we don't progress balanced, our lives will not be on the right track. For example, if we only cling to material things or spiritual matters, the wheel of life will not turn properly.</h3>\n<h3>If we have the right perspective and intention, our material work will also take on a spiritual dimension.</h3>\n<h3>I have brought a few posts from the channel here and at the end, the address of the Telegram channel.</h3>\n<h2>You must progress.<br />\nStrive to be number one in your profession. Show boundless spiritual power in any task you undertake. You are tasked with continuously achieving new successes and not allowing yourself to become an artificial person. All work has a purifying aspect, provided it is done with the right motivation.</h2>\n<h3>We are tasked to approach the duty or problem that is closest to all of us with unlimited energy and strength.<br />\nThis must be our philosophy in life.</h3>\n<h3>By clinging to <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%85%d8%b9%d8%b1%d9%81%db%8c-%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d8%aa%db%8c%d9%85-%d9%81%d9%86%d8%a7%d9%88/\" rel=\"noopener\">creativity</a>, by strengthening and nurturing the power of initiative and developing talents, with the help of the divine power of the Creator, which is obtained through communication with Him during deep concentration movements. By performing work and duties with sincerity, by being faithful to the employer and considering his business as your own, by establishing a close, friendly, and intimate relationship with your direct supervisor and with your cosmic employer, the Creator, you can make your employer in the workplace completely pleased with you. And at the same time, satisfy your divine employer.</h3>\n<h3>Being lazy, idling, expressing helplessness and inability, and consequently avoiding any effort to achieve financial success is an easy and simple task. Earning money and wealth through wrong and dishonorable means is also easy and convenient if the opportunity arises. At the same time, it is by no means correct for a person not to strive to make a living in a healthy and honorable way.</h3>\n<h3>Exceptional men are able to obtain large incomes through friendly, honorable, immediate means, and solely for the pleasure and satisfaction of God and for the satisfaction of others. Such activity enhances their status and character and helps them on their material and spiritual path. Earning and making a living in an honorable and serious manner with perseverance, if its goal is to serve God and humanity, is the second and most important art, after the art of knowing and feeling the presence of the Truth in one's work. The development of responsibility, strengthening the art of organization, order and discipline, leadership and profitability, contribute to success in business and are essential for the comprehensive growth of a human being.</h3>\nsrc=\"/media/how-to-improve-your-work-2.jpg\"You must progress.\n<h3>A lazy person will never find God. An idle mind becomes the workshop of the devil. But those who work hard for their livelihood without expecting results from their work, and whose only desire is God, are the true renunciants of the world.</h3>\n<h3>To act without expecting the fruit and result of that action is truly tyaga (denial of the self). God is the true denier, because He manages all affairs of this universe without expectation and attachment. Whoever desires to realize their divine self, whether they are a renunciate in a monastery or a family person in the world, must do all their efforts for God, live for God, without allowing their emotions to become entangled in His creation.</h3>\n<h3></h3>\n<h3>It is good to be exposed to wind, rain, and sun; because these are all part of <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b4%d8%a8%da%a9%d9%87-%d8%b3%d8%a7%d8%b2%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%b7%d8%a7%d8%aa/\" rel=\"noopener\">life</a>. So instead of worrying about them, enjoy and utilize them. Growth means you absorb something new every day, and absorbing is only possible if you are \"open.\" When you open the doors and windows, rain, wind, and sun come in, and life enters you. Then everything mixes; and if rain comes in, your clothes get wet, but you face a new experience. But if you always live in a closed room, you deprive yourself of new experiences. When new challenges enter your life and disturb it, be calm and patient, because it is in facing these challenges that you reach new heights in the process of growing awareness. Remember that even suffering is a divine grace and mercy. If you deal with suffering correctly, it becomes a step to progress and perfection. Those who have never suffered and have had a comfortable and prosperous life are almost dead. Their life will not be like a winning sword. Intellect only sharpens when you face challenges and struggles of life. Therefore, pray every day: \"O God! Give me more struggles tomorrow. Send me more storms.\" And then you will notice that life is desirable.</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>💎The secret to <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/about-us-1/\" rel=\"noopener\">success</a> is starting. <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/our-team/\" rel=\"noopener\">Successes</a> begin with decisions because until a decision is made, no change occurs in life. Decide to create a future that has no resemblance to your failed past, and know that the distance between not having and having is just a matter of wanting. So, want</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Telegram channel address</p>\n<h3>🌈✨🌈✨🌈✨🌈✨ a444kimiyagari444</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h5>Thank you <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir\" rel=\"noopener\">Mehrdad</a></h5>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Short Link:<br />\n<a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/hxt3\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://mehrdad.ir/hxt3</strong></a></p></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py